    ["<Assistant_Title1>【格尔曼的代行者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>如何让孩子停止哭泣？用戏法，用魔术，或者……用格尔曼？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(868,940)]|-13190;-5940;-1600;2;5200002;0}，与<Assistant_Red>托尼</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gehrman's Proxy】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Extraordinary Roleplay</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>How do you stop a child from crying? Use tricks, use magic, or... use Gehrman?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[Tingen(868,940)]|-13190;-5940;-1600;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> Tony </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>技能增强提高<Mark>35</>。守护附近的队友，使附近小队成员技能抵挡增加<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>35</>. Guards nearby teammates, increasing Skill Block for nearby squad members by <Mark>10</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
