    ["黑板上的裂痕越来越多，终于彻底碎裂。布兰登向学生走去，而他和学生们的轮廓正逐渐消散。\n布兰登：这里必须有一所学校，必须有人点亮通往未来的那盏灯……"] = "The cracks on the blackboard increased, and it finally shattered completely. Brandon walked toward the students, and the outlines of him and the students were gradually dissipating. \nBrandon: There must be a school here, there must be someone to light that lamp leading to the future...",
